flowchart LR
  A[Product event\nmessage, reply, curation, document, data, media] --> B[Admission\nactor, AI identity, origin, feature state]
  B --> C[Context\nconversation, internal retrieval, sources, documents, artifacts]
  C --> D[Route and capability catalog]
  D --> E[Model working round]
  E -->|tool call| F[Typed capability execution]
  F -->|result| E
  E -->|terminal draft| G[Validation and product commit]
  G --> H[Reply, citation, action, artifact, or forum state]
  H --> I[Durable sync and realtime clients]

  F --> J[Asynchronous artifact or job]
  J --> K[Provider or background worker]
  K --> L[Terminal artifact state]
  L --> M[Deduplicated continuation]
  M --> B

  N[(PostgreSQL)] --- B
  N --- C
  N --- G
  N --- H
  O[(Oban and supervised processes)] --- J
  O --- K
